                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "{H} If there are #7 or more boosts# among Characters you control and in your Reserve, each player passes. (Starting with you, they end their Afternoon and don't take any more turns this Day.)",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "{H} Se ci sono #7 o più rinforzi# tra i personaggi che controlli e nella tua Riserva, ciascun giocatore passa. (A cominciare da te, ciascun giocatore termina il pomeriggio e non effettua altri turni in questa giornata.)",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  },
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "{H} Falls es unter den Charakteren, die du kontrollierst, sowie in deiner Reserve #mindestens 7 Verstärkungen# gibt, passt jeder Spieler. (Angefangen bei dir, beenden sie ihren Nachmittag und spielen an diesem Tag keine Runden mehr.)",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  },
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "{H} S'il y a #au moins 7 boosts# parmi les Personnages que vous contrôlez et dans votre Réserve, tous les joueurs passent. (En commençant par vous, ils terminent leur Après-midi et ne jouent plus de tours ce Jour-ci.)",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "{H} Si hay #7 potenciadores o más# entre personajes que controles y en tu reserva, cada jugador pasa. (Empezando por ti, cada jugador termina su tarde y no juega más turnos este día.)",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  }
                },
                "text": "{H} If there are #7 or more boosts# among Characters you control and in your Reserve, each player passes. (Starting with you, they end their Afternoon and don't take any more turns this Day.)"
              }
            ],
            "reference": "01335"
          },
